                <pb facs="1470" n="1354" xml:id="pg1354"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 367.11/103.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-12-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 31, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Consul at Saloniki has now accounted for the safety of all Americans in his
                    district.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
